# The scrollbar colour knobs on HasScrollView. wordproc could set thickness and
# nothing else, so a bar could not be made to match its panel.
#
# Four panes: default, a theme usage, explicit colours, and a thick bar with a
# transparent track. Containment at both sizes, since a bar is positioned from
# the view's rect and that is where the resolution bugs lived.

goto_screen scrollbar_style_lab
wait 0.5
assert_within_parents
validate_screen scrollbar_style_lab

resize 1920 1080
wait 0.3
assert_within_parents
resize 1280 720
wait 0.3
